    "detailed_description": "<h1>Sharing</h1><p>Share your creative disks via Workshop using built-in tools, and play others' creations.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Crapht Box is a <strong>Fantasy Physics Sandbox</strong>. You can craft your machineries with a variety of elements; program your own disks; and edit your scene with built-in tools.<br><br>Crapht Box offers necessary physics elements for framework of your machine construction, sensors/dynamics for input/output, and chips for circuit logic. Programming skill is not required, but you can use the beginner-friendly Wren or Lua language to write something as you like.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Specs.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Display: scalable from 640x480<br></li><li>Audio: 2 music channels, 4 sound effect channels, 1 speech channel<br></li><li>Circuit clock: 60Hz<br></li><li>Code: Wren, Lua<br></li><li>Gamepad: 6 buttons (D-Pad + A/B)<br></li><li>Keyboard and mouse: supported</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/442a6d04a9adff6048eaef6339300680.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.poster.avif?t=1754382829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227090/extras/a2ecb9d9eb2d476f74b2f0ef72640ec7.webm?t=1754382829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin